{"lang":"zh","dir":"ltr","title":"菜单 | La Piñata Taqueria · Vallejo","body":"<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">跳到主要内容</a>\n<header class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"wrap topbar-in\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"../\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">LP</span><span>La Piñata Taqueria</span></a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\"><a href=\"../\">首页</a><a href=\"../#visit\">营业时间和地址</a></nav>\n    <label class=\"lang-pick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20zm6.9 6h-2.9a15.7 15.7 0 0 0-1.4-3.6A8 8 0 0 1 18.9 8zM12 4c.8 1.2 1.5 2.5 1.9 4h-3.8c.4-1.5 1.1-2.8 1.9-4zM4.3 14a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0-4h3.4a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0 4H4.3zm.8 2h2.9c.3 1.3.8 2.5 1.4 3.6A8 8 0 0 1 5.1 16zM8 8H5.1a8 8 0 0 1 4.3-3.6C8.8 5.5 8.3 6.7 8 8zm4 12c-.8-1.2-1.5-2.5-1.9-4h3.8c-.4 1.5-1.1 2.8-1.9 4zm2.3-6H9.7a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0-4h4.6a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0 4zm.3 5.6c.6-1.1 1.1-2.3 1.4-3.6h2.9a8 8 0 0 1-4.3 3.6zM16.3 14a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0-4h3.4a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0 4h-3.4z\"/></svg><select id=\"langSel\" aria-label=\"语言\"><option value=\"en\" lang=\"en\">English</option><option value=\"es\" lang=\"es\">Español</option><option value=\"tl\" lang=\"tl\">Tagalog</option><option value=\"vi\" lang=\"vi\">Tiếng Việt</option><option value=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\" selected>中文</option><option value=\"pa\" lang=\"pa\">ਪੰਜਾਬੀ</option><option value=\"hi\" lang=\"hi\">हिन्दी</option><option value=\"ko\" lang=\"ko\">한국어</option><option value=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">العربية</option></select></label>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17073348381\">点餐</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n<main id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"menu-hero\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <a class=\"back\" href=\"../\">← La Piñata Taqueria</a>\n  <h1>菜单</h1>\n  <p class=\"menu-intro\">塔可、超级卷饼、墨西哥三明治、玉米片和芝士薄饼。</p>\n  <div class=\"menu-source\"><p>价格可能会有变动。</p></div>\n</div><div class=\"stripe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div>\n<nav class=\"menu-chips\" aria-label=\"菜单分类\"><div class=\"wrap\"><a href=\"#m-tacos\">塔可 Tacos</a><a href=\"#m-burritos\">卷饼 Burritos</a><a href=\"#m-tortas-nachos-quesadillas\">墨西哥三明治、玉米片和芝士薄饼</a><a href=\"#m-drinks\">饮料</a><a href=\"#m-extras\">加料</a></div></nav>\n<div class=\"wrap menu-body\">\n<section class=\"menu-sec has-img\" id=\"m-tacos\"><div class=\"menu-sec-body\"><h2>塔可 Tacos</h2><ul class=\"menu-items\"><li class=\"menu-item\"><div class=\"menu-row\"><span class=\"menu-name\">塔可 Taco</span><span class=\"menu-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"menu-price\">$3.50</span></div><p class=\"menu-desc\">自选肉类，配洋葱、香菜和莎莎酱。</p></li></ul><div class=\"menu-choices\"><b>肉类选择</b><ul><li>Asada（烤牛肉）</li><li>Al pastor（香辣腌猪肉）</li><li>Suadero（牛肉）</li><li>Carnitas（手撕猪肉）</li><li>Pollo（鸡肉）</li><li>Lengua（牛舌）</li><li>Cabeza（牛头肉）</li><li>Chorizo（墨西哥辣香肠）</li></ul></div></div><figure class=\"menu-img\"><img src=\"../images/tacos-plate.jpg\" alt=\"一盘 La Piñata 塔可，配香菜、洋葱、萝卜和胡萝卜\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></section><section class=\"menu-sec has-img\" id=\"m-burritos\"><div class=\"menu-sec-body\"><h2>卷饼 Burritos</h2><ul class=\"menu-items\"><li class=\"menu-item\"><div class=\"menu-row\"><span class=\"menu-name\">超级卷饼 Super Burrito</span><span class=\"menu-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"menu-price\">$16</span></div><p class=\"menu-desc\">自选肉类，配米饭、豆子、芝士、酸奶油、pico de gallo 番茄莎莎和莎莎酱。</p></li><li class=\"menu-item\"><div class=\"menu-row\"><span class=\"menu-name\">超级素食卷饼</span><span class=\"menu-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"menu-price\">$14</span></div><p class=\"menu-desc\">烤洋葱、烤甜椒和生菜。</p></li><li class=\"menu-item\"><div class=\"menu-row\"><span class=\"menu-name\">超级鲜虾卷饼</span><span class=\"menu-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"menu-price\">$18</span></div><p class=\"menu-desc\">配烤洋葱和烤甜椒。</p></li><li class=\"menu-item\"><div class=\"menu-row\"><span class=\"menu-name\">牛舌卷饼 Lengua Burrito</span><span class=\"menu-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"menu-price\"></span></div><p class=\"menu-desc\">牛舌。</p></li></ul></div><figure class=\"menu-img\"><img src=\"../images/burrito-cut.jpg\" alt=\"铺在锡纸上切开的 La Piñata 超级卷饼\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></section><section class=\"menu-sec has-img\" id=\"m-tortas-nachos-quesadillas\"><div class=\"menu-sec-body\"><h2>墨西哥三明治、玉米片和芝士薄饼</h2><ul class=\"menu-items\"><li class=\"menu-item\"><div class=\"menu-row\"><span class=\"menu-name\">墨西哥三明治 Torta</span><span class=\"menu-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"menu-price\">$16</span></div><p class=\"menu-desc\">自选肉类，配酸奶油、芝士、洋葱、番茄、墨西哥辣椒、牛油果和生菜。</p></li><li class=\"menu-item\"><div class=\"menu-row\"><span class=\"menu-name\">超级玉米片 Super Nachos</span><span class=\"menu-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"menu-price\">$16</span></div><p class=\"menu-desc\">自选肉类，配豆子、酸奶油、马苏里拉芝士、pico de gallo 番茄莎莎和墨西哥辣椒。</p></li><li class=\"menu-item\"><div class=\"menu-row\"><span class=\"menu-name\">超级芝士薄饼 Super Quesadilla</span><span class=\"menu-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"menu-price\">$16</span></div><p class=\"menu-desc\">自选肉类，配芝士和 pico de gallo 番茄莎莎，酸奶油和莎莎酱另附。</p></li></ul></div><figure class=\"menu-img\"><img src=\"../images/chips-salsas-pickled-veggies.jpg\" alt=\"La Piñata 的玉米片、红绿莎莎酱、腌胡萝卜和一根烤墨西哥辣椒\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>玉米片、莎莎酱和腌菜</figcaption></figure></section><section class=\"menu-sec\" id=\"m-drinks\"><div class=\"menu-sec-body\"><h2>饮料</h2><ul class=\"menu-items\"><li class=\"menu-item\"><div class=\"menu-row\"><span class=\"menu-name\">罐装汽水</span><span class=\"menu-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"menu-price\">$2</span></div></li><li class=\"menu-item\"><div class=\"menu-row\"><span class=\"menu-name\">墨西哥汽水</span><span class=\"menu-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"menu-price\">$3</span></div></li><li class=\"menu-item\"><div class=\"menu-row\"><span class=\"menu-name\">瓶装水</span><span class=\"menu-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"menu-price\">$1</span></div></li><li class=\"menu-item\"><div class=\"menu-row\"><span class=\"menu-name\">半升饮料 Medio Litro</span><span class=\"menu-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"menu-price\">$4</span></div><p class=\"menu-desc\">半升装饮料。</p></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"menu-sec\" id=\"m-extras\"><div class=\"menu-sec-body\"><h2>加料</h2><ul class=\"menu-items\"><li class=\"menu-item\"><div class=\"menu-row\"><span class=\"menu-name\">塔可加芝士、酸奶油或牛油果</span><span class=\"menu-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"menu-price\">$0.25</span></div><p class=\"menu-desc\">每份。</p></li><li class=\"menu-item\"><div class=\"menu-row\"><span class=\"menu-name\">卷饼加芝士、酸奶油或牛油果</span><span class=\"menu-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"menu-price\">$1</span></div><p class=\"menu-desc\">每份。</p></li></ul></div></section>\n\n\n<div class=\"cta-row menu-cta\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"tel:+17073348381\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> 致电 (707) 334-8381</a><a class=\"btn btn-outline btn-lg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%2C%20809%20Broadway%2C%20Vallejo%2C%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> 导航</a></div>\n</div>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"footer\">\n  <div class=\"wrap footer-in\">\n    <div><strong>La Piñata Taqueria</strong><br>809 Broadway, Vallejo, CA 94590 · <a href=\"tel:+17073348381\">(707) 334-8381</a></div>\n    <div class=\"credit\">为 La Piñata Taqueria 制作的演示网站 · 由 Nathaniel Leger 制作 · 并非 La Piñata Taqueri